{
  "_comment": [
    "Contoh entri MCP client (Claude Code / Cursor / VS Code) untuk server MCP",
    "read-only go_starter. SALIN yang relevan ke .mcp.json Anda — file ini contoh.",
    "",
    "TIGA LINGKUNGAN, TIGA ENTRI. Bedakan lewat NAMA. URL menentukan box mana yang",
    "dihubungi; Bearer token membuktikan boleh masuk.",
    "",
    "TOKEN DI HEADER, BUKAN DI URL. Query string (?token=..) bocor ke access-log",
    "reverse proxy; header Authorization tidak. Standar 2026.",
    "",
    "TOKEN VIA ${ENV}, JANGAN DITULIS MENTAH. File .mcp.json aman masuk git;",
    "nilai asli ada di env shell Anda (export GOSTARTER_PROD_TOKEN=...).",
    "",
    "NAMA ENV BEDA per-lingkungan (bukan MCP_TOKEN polos): di satu mesin client,",
    "staging & prod hidup berdampingan — token tak boleh tertukar. (Di SERVER,",
    "tiap container terisolasi, jadi di sana env-nya tetap bernama MCP_TOKEN.)"
  ],

  "mcpServers": {
    "gostarter-dev": {
      "_comment": "Dev lokal: stdio, tanpa server/token. Jalankan langsung.",
      "command": "go",
      "args": ["run", ".", "mcp"]
    },

    "gostarter-staging": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://staging.app-anda.com/mcp",
      "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer ${GOSTARTER_STAGING_TOKEN}" }
    },

    "gostarter-prod": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://app-anda.com/mcp",
      "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer ${GOSTARTER_PROD_TOKEN}" }
    }
  }
}
